# Turkish 3rd-person possessive suffix -(s)I marks the season in the
# year-first construction ("2020 yazı" == "2020's summer"). "yaz" ends in a
# consonant with a back unrounded last vowel (a), so vowel harmony gives -ı:
# yazı. TDK, İyelik ekleri (possessive suffixes): https://sozluk.gov.tr
yaz
yazı
